  "steps": [
    "Base: Blend 60g soaked moong dal with 2 tbsp yogurt, ½ tsp psyllium husk, ¼ tsp baking soda, salt & haldi. Spread on greased parchment.",
    "Paneer: Marinate 190g low-fat paneer with yogurt, ginger-garlic paste, salt, garam masala, dhaniya powder, red chilli & oil spray.",
    "Quick sauce: Blend cooked 2 tomatoes + 6–7 garlic cloves + basil + 2 red chillies + salt. Add a little jaggery/sugar if you like.",
    "Air fry: Base 5 min at 150°C → add sauce, veggies, paneer, mozzarella & basil → 9–10 min at 160°C.",
    "Pan: Cook covered on low-medium flame, flip once cooked, add toppings & cook covered on the lowest flame for 7–8 min."
  ],
